Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:08:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app-core): project-defined tools from .jcode/tools.json

Register a repository's declared commands as first-class tools, loaded from
~/.jcode/tools.json and <working dir>/.jcode/tools.json. Tool input arrives as
JSON on stdin; stdout is the result. Names, descriptions and JSON schemas are
declared by the repo, so workflows no longer need an MCP server (and its
mcp__<server>__ prefix) to get native tool names.
